{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-06-11T03:28:04.367Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__2aa7850z","parameters":{"allow_multiple":false,"old_string":"        // Gather painted items belonging to the submit input box\n        let input_box = layout.children.iter().find(|child| child.node == Some(input)).expect(\"input should have a layout box\");\n        let input_rect = input_box.rect;\n\n        let input_items: Vec<&DisplayItem> = items.iter().filter(|item| {\n            match item {\n                DisplayItem::SolidRect { rect, .. } => {\n                    (rect.origin.x - input_rect.origin.x).abs() < 1e-3 && (rect.origin.y - input_rect.origin.y).abs() < 1e-3\n                }\n                DisplayItem::Text { rect, .. } => {\n                    rect.origin.x >= input_rect.origin.x && rect.origin.x < input_rect.origin.x + input_rect.size.width\n                }\n                _ => false,\n            }\n        }).collect();","new_string":"        // Gather painted items belonging to the submit input box\n        let input_box = layout.children.iter().find(|child| child.node == Some(input)).expect(\"input should have a layout box\");\n        let input_rect = input_box.rect;\n\n        let input_items: Vec<&DisplayItem> = items.iter().filter(|item| {\n            match item {\n                DisplayItem::SolidRect { rect, .. } => {\n                    rect.origin.x >= input_rect.origin.x && rect.origin.x < input_rect.origin.x + input_rect.size.width\n                        && rect.origin.y >= input_rect.origin.y && rect.origin.y < input_rect.origin.y + input_rect.size.height\n                }\n                DisplayItem::Text { rect, .. } => {\n                    rect.origin.x >= input_rect.origin.x && rect.origin.x < input_rect.origin.x + input_rect.size.width\n                }\n                _ => false,\n            }\n        }).collect();","instruction":"Update the bounding box filters in test_ua_form_styling_paint_and_computed_properties to properly collect all 4 border strips.","file_path":"src/paint/mod.rs"}}
